From d678c245892927d14e993c4635b8f856054f270e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AliGram <aligram@local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:07:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/67] feat(aligram): wire preservation hooks
 (H-I/H-C/H-E/H-D, deferred-delete guards)

H-I: pre-existence probe at the putMessagesInternal loop top (before
REPLACE) + maybeIngest right after the auto-download block.
H-C: DownloadController fileLoaded / fileLoadFailed /
fileLoadProgressChanged -> onFileLoaded / onFileLoadFailed /
onFileLoadProgress (observer registered at construction, before any
H-I loadFile; R-19 second wake-up is the watchdog/probe in the
controller).
H-E: Stage-A pin (pinForEdit) + LIVE-sync (liveSyncEdit, outside the
from_id / E checks, pin first) before addFilesToDelete in the
load_type == -2 branch; H-3 pin in emptyMessagesMedia; Phase-B bind
via EditedMessageDao.insert now returning the fakeId.
H-D: bindDeleted / onDeleteGateBlocked in AyuMessagesController;
captured-delete notes in the remote snapshot runnable and the
secret-chat path; mark-path sweep in markMessagesAsDeletedInternal
(mode 0 only), clear-history sweep in the single-message internal,
deleteUserChatHistory + deleteDialog (incl. messagesOnly == 2
except-variant) sweeps.
Deferred delete: Layer-1 guard in addFilesToDelete (all call sites),
Layer-2 guard inside FileLoader.deleteFiles (all six call sites
funnel through it), pinned-name filter in cancelLoadFiles /
cancelLoadAllFiles (never cancel an in-flight freeze copy).
Guard holes closed: shouldSaveMedia applied at both
markMessagesAsDeletedInternal entries (secret-chat + clear-history).
Manual clear: CacheControlActivity skips pinned files at both
deletion sites. Eviction: AutoDeleteMediaTask skips pinned sources
(H-1 sequenced fix). Logout: purgeAccount (P-8).
Server round: processUpdateArray tail -> onServerRoundCompleted
(R-7 stamping signal).
